### Critical warning

The current lazy placed-feature pipeline is **transitional**.

A known failure mode is that a multi-chunk fixed structure can be preflighted independently per current chunk. That can create half buildings.

Do **not** fix this by force-writing neighboring chunks.

The durable fix is a **single global object-level acceptance decision** plus chunk-local emission of already-approved pieces.

